From 8669d6c8a3937b8c1b634a7f103c257cef13b5b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:59:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Step 4 hotfix: never create branch equal to main (root cause
 of 'No commits between main and <branch>')
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- client.ensure_branch_at(): create-or-reset ref AFTER successful commit
- create_blob_commit: base = existing branch HEAD if branch lives (PR update),
  explicit RuntimeError on empty tree instead of silent identical branch
- publisher._repo_slug: Windows/local paths (F:\..., /tmp/...) no longer parsed
  as owner/repo -> fallback demo_repo
- new CLI 'seed-pr': test PR from gold case applied via git apply in local
  clone demo_repo/ (branch strictly from origin/main of DEMO repo, no history
  mixing with DocScribe) — implements agreed ritual point 1
- .gitignore: demo_repo/, data/work/
- +2 unit tests (slug parsing, ensure_branch_at); 31 passed
